    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/AntiochRamparts.jpg/250px-AntiochRamparts.jpg
    width: 435
    height: 479
    caption: The ramparts of Antioch climbing Mons Silpius during the Crusades
